        <mxCell id="k3XmHFzbHbkUWzh0nUTK-58" value="&lt;div&gt;Monitors all the files in the config&#39;s &quot;xdg-data-dirs&quot;/aplications (the global iinstance) and $HOME/.local/share/applications (for each zone as a per-user instance) and&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;creates new .desktop files based on the existing ones and the per zone configuration, and may also remove existing desktop entries." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;size=12;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;labelBackgroundColor=none;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
