        <mxCell id="3q5PWIiPAixXGdPgq-z4-2" value="When systemd is asked to stop a service, by default (kill-mode=control-group), the TERM signal is sent to all the processes in the same control group. (refer to&amp;nbsp;https://www.freedesktop.org/software/&lt;div&gt;systemd/man/latest/systemd.kill.html)&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#000000;size=11;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
