        <mxCell id="-MyexHzmpBfktQcxta-H-37" value="&lt;div&gt;The USER VM version is generated each time a BASE VM version is run and the USER VM version does not exist&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;If the &lt;b&gt;padsi-guest&lt;/b&gt; package is installed:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Apply some minor, user-related settings:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;- set the user name, UID, GID&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;- mount the host FS at the correct path&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;- set some licence keys&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Note:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;- can be done without starting the VM for Linux?&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#000000;size=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;spacingLeft=5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1300" y="790" width="330" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="-MyexHzmpBfktQcxta-H-38" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(251, 251, 251); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;Most of the scripts require the guest to run a local SSH server (on a dedicated port, e.g. 26 (unused) to be able to filter the network access) and some scripts (bash, powershell, cmd) =&amp;gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(251, 251, 251); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;padsi-guest&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;package&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=14;" parent="1" vertex="1">
